        "Temperature tolerance": "population dependent (e.g. between spain + britain) - Spanish population recovered from 32C, Britain/Danish/Norwegian populations didn't recover from 28C. New source: species within genus max temp 23C or 25C (Fucus gardneri, 25C; Fucus spiralis)",
